    "Balanced and ProRAW scene files saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Balanced 和 ProRAW 场景文件已保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Balanced combines four equal-exposure Bayer RAW frames with curvature reconstruction at 2× sampling.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Balanced 合成四张等曝光 Bayer RAW，使用曲率重建，横纵各 2× 采样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Balanced merged RAW and original ProRAW are saved before color processing. Finished photos still save to Photos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Balanced 合成 RAW 和原始 ProRAW 会在调色前保存，调色成片照常保存到相册。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
